# --- Staging area for things on their way out ---
# It held a working-tree tarball of the whole repo — which means it held
# `infra/.env`, `key.pem` and `zenpdf-dev.p12`, i.e. everything the block above
# exists to keep out of git. A `git add -A` swept it into a commit; ignoring the
# directory is what stops the next one.
_to_delete/

